      <a href="#iclass_single_vectors">Single vectors</a>
      , 
      <a href="#iclass_multiple_and_single_vectors">Multiple and single vectors</a>
       and 
      <a href="#iclass_multiple_vectors">Multiple vectors</a>
    </p>
